        "Each governance decision = 1 chunk (decision, retired value, canonical value, authority)",
        "Each BD target = 1 chunk (company, drug, gap_hook, fit_score, outreach_channel)",
        "Each biomarker = 1 chunk (biomarker, prevalence, source, admissibility_tier)",
        "Narrative documents (MD files >2000 chars) = chunked at section headers (##)",
        "JSON files = chunked at top-level array entries or named objects",
        "CSV files = chunked at 50-row blocks with header preserved in each chunk"
